            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1" style="color: hsl(220,26%,12%);">Transparency First</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: hsl(220,9%,46%);">We share exactly how we make money. Our revenue comes from partner commissions — and we pass the majority back to you.</p>
