          <details class="border-b" style="border-color: hsl(220,13%,91%);">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between py-4 font-semibold text-left" style="color: hsl(220,26%,12%);">
              How does Web3Cashback make money?
              <svg class="chevron h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 ml-3" style="color: hsl(220,9%,46%);" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: hsl(220,9%,46%);">We earn a revenue share from our partner platforms when you sign up through us. Instead of keeping all of it, we pass the majority back to you as cashback. We win when you win.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="border-b" style="border-color: hsl(220,13%,91%);">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between py-4 font-semibold text-left" style="color: hsl(220,26%,12%);">
              How is cashback calculated?
              <svg class="chevron h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 ml-3" style="color: hsl(220,9%,46%);" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: hsl(220,9%,46%);">Cashback is based on real revenue generated from your activity — not deposits. The exact rate depends on the partner and your loyalty tier. Everything is transparently shown in your dashboard.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="border-b" style="border-color: hsl(220,13%,91%);">
