            </summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: hsl(220,9%,46%);">Cashback is credited monthly in USDC. You can withdraw anytime — minimum 50 USDC, no waiting periods.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="border-b" style="border-color: hsl(220,13%,91%);">
