            <p class="pb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: hsl(220,9%,46%);">The more you earn through Web3Cashback (your own cashback + referral rewards), the higher your status climbs. Higher status means boosted cashback rates and bigger referral percentages.</p>
